<p>I see that <code>jQuery</code> has been added to <code>package.json</code> and <code>yarn.lock</code>.</p>
<p>I added <code>require('jquery')</code> to app/javascript/packs/application.js:</p>
<pre><code>import './public-path';
import loadPolyfills from '../mastodon/load_polyfills';
