<p>I am yet to add a <code>handle_connection</code> method, would I have to define the handle_connection to sit in a loop and spawn tasks?</p>
<pre><code>    pub async fn accept_connections(&amp;self) {
        loop {
            let (mut stream, addr) = self.listener.accept().await.unwrap();
