Title: c++ read data from file and convert to template type of class.
Body: <p>Following case:</p>
<pre><code>template &lt;typename NumberType = double&gt;
class A
{
   //constructur, destructor,...

   //member variable
   std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;NumberType&gt; matrix_;

   //member function
   void read(std::ifstream fileIn)
   {
       std::string line, word;
       unsigned int row = 0;
       while (std::getline(fileIn, line))
       {
         std::istringstream lineStream(line);
         unsigned int col = 0;
         while (std::getline(lineStream, word, ','))
            {
