Title: My Flutter ListView is always removing the last item from the list.
Body: <p>I'm creating a Flutter Widget and when I try to remove an item from the list I'm using, it always removes the last one, I was thinking it could be a <code>Key</code> problem, but nothing suits it, do anyone know how I could solve this?</p>
<h2>The code</h2>
<p>create_game.dart</p>
