Title: Build express server with webpack typescript and esm.
Body: <p>I'm trying to build a small project <code>node.js + ts</code> using <code>webpack</code>.</p>
<pre><code>tsconfig.json
{
  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {
    &quot;lib&quot;: [&quot;ESNext&quot;],
    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;ES2020&quot;,
