</ul>
<p><strong>UPD</strong>
I've tried change tsconfig.The first option is to open your tsconfig.json file and look for compilerOptions. Set target to &quot;ES5&quot; and module to &quot;CommonJS&quot; (or completely remove the module option).</p>
<pre><code>{
