<p>I get this error in the console for every row in the dataset:</p>
<pre><code>Error: &lt;path&gt; attribute d: Expected number, &quot;M0,NaNL122.5,NaNL24…&quot;.
</code></pre>
<p>Which made me think there is a problem in the y coordinates of the path function, so I added various print function to see why there is NaN as the second coordinate.</p>
<p>here the parallelplot.js file:</p>
<pre><code>// set the dimensions and margins of the graph
var margin = {top: 30, right: 30, bottom: 10, left: 40},
