Title: D3 ignoring bars with same data despite using a key function.
Body: <p>I'm trying to create a Bar chart and add mouseover and mouseout events on the bars. I'm using scaleBand() in my code. Therefore, from the accepted solution <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/32597482/3766946">here</a>, I gathered that ordinal scale treats repeated values as same. Therefore, I tried adding a key to the data() function which I expected would resolve the issue and give me all my bars, but that did not happen.</p>
<p>Here's my code:</p>
