Title: std::binomial_distribution hangs forever with certain inputs.
Body: <p>I have encountered some odd behavior with <code>std::binomial_distribution</code> when compiling with <code>clang++</code> (with <code>libstdc++</code> standard library).</p>
<p>Consider the following simple program:</p>
<pre><code>#include &lt;ctime&gt;
