&lt;iframe id="bing" width="800" height="500" src="http://wwww.bing.com" /&gt; </code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</p>
<ul>
<li>I have also tried the <code>sandbox</code> attribute mention in this <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/q/70940758/15113491">question</a> but it dosen't work for my case.</li>
</ul>
<p>Do you have any suggestions on preventing the <code>iframe</code> from stealing the focus and scrolling the user down?</p>

