       at android.content.res.TypedArray.getDrawable(TypedArray.java:982)


Caused by android.content.res.Resources$NotFoundException: Resource ID #0x7f08090e
       at android.content.res.ResourcesImpl.getValueForDensity(ResourcesImpl.java:248)
       at android.content.res.Resources.getValueForDensity(Resources.java:1385)
       at android.graphics.drawable.BitmapDrawable.updateStateFromTypedArray(BitmapDrawable.java:819)
</code></pre>
<p><a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/pXYfV.jpg" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/pXYfV.jpg" alt="enter image description here" /></a></p>
<p><strong>Its giving resource not found for - <strong>res/drawable/background_splash.xml</strong>, which is clearly available.</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/wLG6k.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/wLG6k.png" alt="enter image description here" /></a></p>
<p>background_splash.xml is something like this:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;utf-8&quot;?&gt;
&lt;layer-list xmlns:android=&quot;http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android&quot;&gt;

