        android:drawable=&quot;@drawable/splash_logo_p4b_new&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/item&gt;

    &lt;item
        android:gravity=&quot;bottom|fill_horizontal&quot;
        android:drawable=&quot;@drawable/blue_bottom_strip&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/item&gt;

&lt;/layer-list&gt;.      
</code></pre>
<p><strong>blue_bottom_strip and splash_logo_p4b_new</strong> are images of png formats.</p>
<p>and how this vector is used as a background in the Activity theme like this.</p>
<pre><code>    &lt;style name=&quot;ThemeSplashScreen&quot; parent=&quot;Theme.AppCompat.Light.NoActionBar&quot;&gt;
    &lt;item name=&quot;colorPrimary&quot;&gt;@color/colorPrimary&lt;/item&gt;
    &lt;item name=&quot;colorPrimaryDark&quot;&gt;@color/color_white&lt;/item&gt;
    &lt;item name=&quot;android:windowNoTitle&quot;&gt;true&lt;/item&gt;
    &lt;item name=&quot;android:background&quot;&gt;@drawable/background_splash&lt;/item&gt;
    &lt;item name=&quot;android:windowContentOverlay&quot;&gt;@null&lt;/item&gt;
    &lt;item name=&quot;android:backgroundDimEnabled&quot;&gt;false&lt;/item&gt;
&lt;/style&gt;.      
</code></pre>
<p>Use of this theme in Android Manifest -</p>
<pre><code>   &lt;activity
        android:name=&quot;.splash.SplashActivity&quot;
        android:launchMode=&quot;singleTask&quot;
        android:screenOrientation=&quot;portrait&quot;
        android:theme=&quot;@style/ThemeSplashScreen&quot;
        android:exported=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>It could be because of <a href="https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-screen" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-screen</a>, looking into it.</p>
<p><strong>Could you help me how to analyse the root cause here? Thanks you for your time and attention.</strong></p>
<p><strong>EDIT - 28 Marhch 2023</strong></p>
<p>This crash is fixed in Android 12+ devices after we applied <a href="https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-screen/migrate" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Migrate your existing splash screen implementation to Android 12 and higher</a>, we did have some issues regarding the branding image dimension related issue
<a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/75368672/migration-of-exisitng-splashscreen-to-android-12-is-giving-distorted-splash">Migration of exisitng splashScreen to Android 12 + is giving distorted splash</a>.</p>
<p>So Now I have left with this issue for only in Android 11 and 11- devices.
Why does it say that resource can't be found?</p>

