Title: Highchart map in R with mappoint series and marker-clusters module.
Body: <p>I want to make a map in R which clusters points when zoomed out. I'm using the <code>highcharter</code> package.</p>
<p>Screenshot of what I'm aiming for, from a demo at <a href="https://www.highcharts.com/docs/maps/marker-clusters#introduction" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.highcharts.com/docs/maps/marker-clusters#introduction</a>:</p>
