Title: Highcharts - How to use chart.zooming.mouseWheel.
Body: <p>According to the latest release (v11.1.0) <a href="https://www.highcharts.com/blog/changelog/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">change log</a>:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Added support for mouse wheel zooming through chart.zooming.mouseWheel. This feature is embedded in the Highcharts Stock bundle, but requires an additional module file for the Highcharts bundle.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'm building a <strong>line chart</strong>. I want to add this functionality to it but not exactly sure how.</p>
<p>I'm using Vue 3.</p>
<p>Here's my code:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;template&gt;
  &lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center&quot;&gt;Facilities Analyst&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;highcharts class=&quot;chart&quot; :options=&quot;lineChartOptions&quot;&gt;&lt;/highcharts&gt;
&lt;/template&gt;


