Title: Using Highcharts to create an items chart (aka &quot;waffle&quot; chart) - how to I control padding?.
Body: <p>I am using Highcharts to create a waffle chart. Here's a good example:</p>
<p><a href="https://datavizproject.com/data-type/percentage-grid/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://datavizproject.com/data-type/percentage-grid/</a></p>
