<p>So I can see in console that <code>store.getState().value</code> does change, but in rendered <code>&lt;div className=&quot;UpperTitle&quot;&gt;</code> <code>{name}</code> does not change. As you can see I tried to subscribe my App() function as well, but that did not help at all. Appreciate any help.</p>
<p>I manage to make it somehow work if I subscibe render() in index.js, but that seemed wrong and cause a warning message</p>
