Body: <p>I'm performing React tests with Jest and after the test runs it returns the error <code>TypeError: Cannot destructure property 'basename' of 'React__namespace.useContext(...)' as it is null.</code> on the line <code>render(&lt;Carrinho ItensCarrinho={ itensCarrinho } incrementeCarrinho={ incrementeCarrinhoMock } decrementeCarrinho={ decrementeCarrinhoMock }/&gt;);</code>.</p>
