wait  - compiling /_error (client and server)...
error - ../../packages/core/icons/Icon.tsx:14:0
Module not found: Can't resolve '@mui/material/css'
import { css, styled } from &quot;@mui/material&quot;;
</code></pre>
<p>I tried a lot of things and managed to get another similar bug, but with the alpha function (and some others as well). I assume the modularizeImports parameters are not correct, but I don't know how it should be correct.</p>

