<p>I am only running into one error, and I genuinely have no idea how it's even possible. My program prints out everything it should (words misspelled, words in dictionary, etc) but at the end, It runs an infinite loop again - no $ sign appears and the white cursor just stays there forever. This is especially confusing because after all of those printf statements are done, the program should immediately return 0. Does anyone have any idea where this could be happening?</p>
