Body: <p>I just upgraded Angular &amp; Angular Material to v15. I started to get various errors and I narrowed them down to one component that is using <a href="https://rc.material.angular.io/components/slider/overview" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><code>mat-slider</code></a>.</p>
