}
</code></pre>
<p>In the app, I have a settings page where I call a manual widget refresh (for debugging for now) like this:</p>
<pre class="lang-swift prettyprint-override"><code>Button(&quot;Reload Widget&quot;) {
            print(&quot;calling widgetcenter&quot;)
