<p>I added a video under wwwroot, which I'm trying to access via a client app. The idea is to stream it through a MediaSource object. Here's a code snippet:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;video controls&gt;&lt;/video&gt;
    &lt;script&gt;
