<p>When I replace the <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.commandline.argument?view=system-commandline" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Argument</a> class with the <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.commandline.option.-ctor?view=system-commandline" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Option</a>, it works as expected:</p>
