        &lt;a target=&quot;_self&quot; href=&quot;#{{control.formControlName}}&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;error_message_id&quot; *ngFor=&quot;let error of control?.validations&quot;&gt;{{ 'Common.EnterYourText' | translate }} {{ control.label | translate }}&lt;/a&gt;
      &lt;/ng-container&gt;
      &lt;ng-container *ngIf=&quot;control.formControlName === 'chassisNumber' &amp;&amp; formGroup.get(control.formControlName)?.value?.length !== control.maxLength&quot;&gt;
        &lt;a target=&quot;_self&quot; href=&quot;#{{control.formControlName}}&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;error_message_id&quot; class=&quot;govcy-anchor&quot;&gt;{{ 'Barricades.ChassisNumberMessage' | translate }}&lt;/a&gt;
      &lt;/ng-container&gt;
    &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/ng-container&gt;
&lt;/ng-container&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>FormControlsComponent.html
this is the html file where the form controls are placed into</p>
<pre><code>&lt;ng-container *ngIf=&quot;field&quot;&gt;
&lt;form [formGroup]=&quot;formGroup&quot; class=&quot;govcy-form&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;input-wrapper govcy-form-control&quot;&gt;
        &lt;input 
        [type]=&quot;field?.type&quot; 
        [formControlName]=&quot;field?.formControlName&quot; 
        [readonly]=&quot;field?.isReadOnly&quot; 
        [ngClass]=&quot;{
         'govcy-text-input': field?.formControlName !== 'code',
         'custom-input': field?.formControlName === 'code',
         'govcy-text-input-error': isFormControlInvalid(field, formGroup)
        }&quot; 
        [maxlength]=&quot;field?.maxLength&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>i have tried using the href and id approach but it is not working.
Thank you !</p>

