<p>For testing: First I go to the page <code>http://localhost:8000/InspectionDocument/test</code>. Then the page loads, without returning any error like this:
<a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/NU1KO.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/NU1KO.png" alt="enter image description here" /></a></p>
