<p>Apparently only the first object is affected. This is the output.</p>
<pre><code>0: Object
hex: &quot;#ff0000&quot;
used: false
1: Object
hex: &quot;#00ff00&quot;
used: true
2: Object
hex: &quot;#0000ff&quot;
used: true
</code></pre>
<p>Here is the sandbox: <a href="https://codesandbox.io/s/strange-water-p19ihj?file=/src/app/app.component.ts" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://codesandbox.io/s/strange-water-p19ihj?file=/src/app/app.component.ts</a></p>
<p>It works with _.map and with native forEach. Am I missing something or is it a bug?</p>

