Title: Calculate ERC20 token buy/sell tax.
Body: <p>I am trying to implement a method for calculating token buy/sell tax. The one that devs implement it in the <code>transfer()</code> function.</p>
<p>I've done some research and there are 2 options.</p>
<ol>
<li><code>eth_call</code> - simulate a swap, calculate the difference</li>
<li>deploy the <code>ERC20</code> smart contract on a local hardhat/ganache, execute swap and see the difference</li>
</ol>
<p>The <code>eth_call</code> seems to be better for me but I'm facing some issues.</p>
<pre><code> // Encode function data
        const encodedData = router.interface.encodeFunctionData('swapExactETHForTokens', [
            0,
