Title: node axios call does not await promise.
Body: <p>When I make network call via axios, the consuming service does not await it</p>
<p><strong>Executing function:</strong></p>
<pre><code>accountResolved: (atNumber, bkCode) =&gt; {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {
