Body: <p>I'm following <a href="https://rudrastyh.com/wordpress/quick-edit-tutorial.html#populate-columns" rel="nofollow noreferrer">this tutorial by Misha Rudrastyh</a> to add &quot;Custom Fields in WordPress Quick Edit&quot; feature. I have made it though most of the tutorial successfully (step 1, 2 and 3), but I am having trouble on the final step 4, which involves adding a script to populate the fields.</p>
<pre class="lang-php prettyprint-override"><code>add_action( 'admin_footer', 'min_max_step_desc_quick_edit_populate');
