Title: Can React apps be embedded into a PowerPoint?.
Body: <p>I'm trying to create a PowerPoint <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/office/dev/add-ins/design/content-add-ins" rel="nofollow noreferrer">content add-in</a> with Office JS and the PowerPoint JavaScript API that is capable of embedding HTML and React components into slides. This is my first time trying to create a PowerPoint add-in, so any suggestions or advice are greatly appreciated.</p>
