</code></pre>
<blockquote>
<p>From the above-given image, create a function that takes 2 fields as an argument:
-   a letter (in our case, A, B, C, D)
-   Time in milliseconds will be any distinct values provided by you</p>
<p>Inside the function, there must be a setTimeout with the value as above-mentioned time</p>
<p>The main function will start the execution such that the above-created function will be executed in the chronology specified above, i.e.:
