<p><a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/QWSbY.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/QWSbY.png" alt="enter image description here" /></a></p>
<p>Now the code for year is as follow</p>
<pre><code>  const minAppDate = new Date(
  new Date().getFullYear() - 7,
  new Date().getMonth(),
