    {
    id: 8,
    displayName: &quot;Equipment&quot;,
    parentFolderId: 3,
    // ... rest of object
  },
  // ... rest of objects
];
</code></pre>
<p>I want a result that looks like this, based on the input above:</p>
<pre><code>const menuItems = [
  {
    id: 1,
